Please design a lightweight narrative blueprint for this short story based on the following story specifications. The blueprint will guide subsequent beat generation and draft writing, ensuring the story structure consciously controls the emotional arc and pacing.

**Important**: Please pay special attention to anchoring the "time-place-character-event" four elements. With the limited length of short stories, any drift in any element will destroy narrative consistency.

